  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to Peace building for LRA victims in Tore and Lasu payams</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a one year project primarily aiming at promoting the well-being and peace building in communities affected by LRA attacks in Tore and Lasu payams, Yei County and, to secondarily build and strengthen the capacity of local structures in trauma healing and peer counselling to mitigate potential conflicts in the mentioned communities.
RECONCILE will conduct training workshops for various community leaders and volunteers who will be deployed in the affected communities to offer couselling and make referrals for cases that are severely traumatised for professional counselling through RECONCILE. The project will have a component of grassroots lobying and advocacy in collaboration with other agencies and government structures.</narrative>
  </description>
